  "pseudocode": "1. dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n2. for i = 1 to n:\n3.   curr_w = 0, curr_h = 0\n4.   for j = i - 1 down to 0:\n5.     curr_w += books[j].width\n6.     if curr_w > shelfWidth: break\n7.     curr_h = max(curr_h, books[j].height)\n8.     dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[j] + curr_h)",
